### Pozivi API-ja (IntelliJ HTTP klijent ili VS Code REST Client)
### Aplikacija mora raditi na http://localhost:8080 (baza: docker compose up -d)

@host = http://localhost:8080

### ---------- Vozila ----------

### Kreiraj vozilo -> 201 + Location
POST {{host}}/api/v1/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kompaktni EV",
  "batteryKwh": 60,
  "consumptionKwhPer100km": 18,
  "maxChargePowerKw": 150
}

### Dohvati vozilo -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/vehicles/1

### Vozilo ne postoji -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/vehicles/999999

### Neispravno vozilo (prazno ime, prevelika baterija, nedostaje polje) -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "batteryKwh": 500,
  "consumptionKwhPer100km": 18
}

### Neispravan JSON -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{ ovo nije json

### ---------- Punionice ----------

### Prva stranica (zadano page=0, size=20) -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stations

### Druga stranica od 5 -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stations?page=1&size=5

### size veći od 200 -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stations?size=201

### Negativna stranica -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stations?page=-1

### Dohvati punionicu -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stations/S0001

### Punionica ne postoji -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/stations/S9999

### ---------- Putovanja ----------

### Zagreb 1 -> Dubrovnik 1 (lab 7.6: 2 zaustavljanja, 492,5 km, ~372 min) -> 201 + Location
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "fromStationId": "S0001",
  "toStationId": "S0177",
  "startSocPercent": 80,
  "minSocPercent": 10,
  "departureTime": "2026-11-15T08:00:00Z"
}

### Dohvati putovanje -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/trips/1

### Putovanje ne postoji -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/trips/999999

### Ista polazna i odredišna punionica -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "fromStationId": "S0001",
  "toStationId": "S0001",
  "startSocPercent": 80,
  "minSocPercent": 10,
  "departureTime": "2026-11-15T08:00:00Z"
}

### startSocPercent nije veći od minSocPercent -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "fromStationId": "S0001",
  "toStationId": "S0177",
  "startSocPercent": 20,
  "minSocPercent": 20,
  "departureTime": "2026-11-15T08:00:00Z"
}

### Pogreške validacije (izvan raspona, nedostaju polja) -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "fromStationId": "",
  "startSocPercent": 120
}

### Vozilo ne postoji -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 999999,
  "fromStationId": "S0001",
  "toStationId": "S0177",
  "startSocPercent": 80,
  "minSocPercent": 10,
  "departureTime": "2026-11-15T08:00:00Z"
}

### Punionica ne postoji -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "fromStationId": "S0001",
  "toStationId": "S9999",
  "startSocPercent": 80,
  "minSocPercent": 10,
  "departureTime": "2026-11-15T08:00:00Z"
}

### Odredište nije dostižno -> 422
### Prvo kreiraj vozilo s vrlo malim dometom (10 kWh, 50 kWh/100 km) ...
# @name smallCar
POST {{host}}/api/v1/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mali domet",
  "batteryKwh": 10,
  "consumptionKwhPer100km": 50,
  "maxChargePowerKw": 50
}

### ... pa s njim pokušaj Zagreb -> Dubrovnik uz minimalno 50 % -> 422
POST {{host}}/api/v1/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": {{smallCar.response.body.id}},
  "fromStationId": "S0001",
  "toStationId": "S0177",
  "startSocPercent": 80,
  "minSocPercent": 50,
  "departureTime": "2026-11-15T08:00:00Z"
}

### ---------- Actuator ----------

### Zdravlje aplikacije (status UP, baza UP)
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
